    "detailed_description": "Tokeis is a real-time board-like city builder focused on growing your empire from scratch. In Tokeis, everything is a token. Gather buildings, build units, acquire modifiers, and explore the procedurally generated map to leverage every advantage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 Build</h2><br>Your citizens provide you with the power to spawn new building tokens. Take a building, place it, build it, and profit \ud83d\udcb0. Different structures have different requirements and affect / are affected by their surroundings \u2013 plan your empires' layout carefully. Of course, you can always rearrange.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/8b72ba443ce6fe204232eccc7389a4d4.poster.avif?t=1696060997\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/8b72ba443ce6fe204232eccc7389a4d4.webm?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/8b72ba443ce6fe204232eccc7389a4d4.mp4?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Expand</h2><br>More tiles mean more space and resources! However, you need an infrastructure to expand your view and allow more opportunities. Keep your economy strong since unmaintained infrastructure could be the beginning of the end of your mighty kingdom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/c7202d0196c5ffda821a03985d2ba556.poster.avif?t=1696060997\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/c7202d0196c5ffda821a03985d2ba556.webm?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/c7202d0196c5ffda821a03985d2ba556.mp4?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Survive</h2><br>Sooner or later, Mother Nature or vicious bandits will try to take your riches. You must ensure your treasury stays full, your people fed, and your infrastructure standing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/7d05e149efe808c677bf4eb2176834bb.poster.avif?t=1696060997\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/7d05e149efe808c677bf4eb2176834bb.webm?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/7d05e149efe808c677bf4eb2176834bb.mp4?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83c\udfe0 Build your city<br></li><li> \ud83d\udcc8 Fortify economy<br></li><li> \ud83d\udcb0 Gather unique tokens<br></li><li> \u26c5 Survive the weather<br></li><li> \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Defend against raiders<br></li><li> \ud83d\uddfb All in procedurally generated maps<br></li><li> \u2705 And of course, hexagons == bestagons</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Tokeis is a real-time board-like city builder focused on growing your empire from scratch. In Tokeis, everything is a token. Gather buildings, build units, acquire modifiers, and explore the procedurally generated map to leverage every advantage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28 Build</h2><br>Your citizens provide you with the power to spawn new building tokens. Take a building, place it, build it, and profit \ud83d\udcb0. Different structures have different requirements and affect / are affected by their surroundings \u2013 plan your empires' layout carefully. Of course, you can always rearrange.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/8b72ba443ce6fe204232eccc7389a4d4.poster.avif?t=1696060997\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/8b72ba443ce6fe204232eccc7389a4d4.webm?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/8b72ba443ce6fe204232eccc7389a4d4.mp4?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Expand</h2><br>More tiles mean more space and resources! However, you need an infrastructure to expand your view and allow more opportunities. Keep your economy strong since unmaintained infrastructure could be the beginning of the end of your mighty kingdom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/c7202d0196c5ffda821a03985d2ba556.poster.avif?t=1696060997\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/c7202d0196c5ffda821a03985d2ba556.webm?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/c7202d0196c5ffda821a03985d2ba556.mp4?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Survive</h2><br>Sooner or later, Mother Nature or vicious bandits will try to take your riches. You must ensure your treasury stays full, your people fed, and your infrastructure standing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/7d05e149efe808c677bf4eb2176834bb.poster.avif?t=1696060997\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/7d05e149efe808c677bf4eb2176834bb.webm?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573040/extras/7d05e149efe808c677bf4eb2176834bb.mp4?t=1696060997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83c\udfe0 Build your city<br></li><li> \ud83d\udcc8 Fortify economy<br></li><li> \ud83d\udcb0 Gather unique tokens<br></li><li> \u26c5 Survive the weather<br></li><li> \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Defend against raiders<br></li><li> \ud83d\uddfb All in procedurally generated maps<br></li><li> \u2705 And of course, hexagons == bestagons</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Tokeis is a board-like real-time city builder about growing your town from a tiny tile to a hexagonal empire. Collect tokens, manage resources, reorganize inefficiencies, and fortify your economy. Handle the harsh weather and defend against raiders trying to steal your riches!",
